# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# ENGLISH JANALA - files that must never be committed
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------- macOS system files ----------
# .DS_Store and ._* (AppleDouble resource forks) are created by Finder,
# especially on external/ExFAT drives. They are pure metadata, never part of
# the site, and were being pushed to GitHub before this file existed.
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
Temporary Items
Network Trash Folder

# ---------- editors / IDEs ----------
.vscode/
.idea/
.history/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---------- dependencies ----------
node_modules/
jspm_packages/

# ---------- logs ----------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------- environment / secrets ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------- build output & coverage ----------
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/

# ---------- other OS / temp junk ----------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej

# ---------- optional: local scratch files ----------
# test.js (a small createElements experiment) and the empty tailwind.config.js
# are not used by the site, which runs on the Tailwind v4 browser build.
# They are still tracked on purpose, so uncomment the two lines below AND run
#   git rm --cached test.js tailwind.config.js
# if you want the repository to stop carrying them.
# test.js
# tailwind.config.js